---
/**
 * /gym-fitness-flooring — Gym & Fitness Rubber Flooring category hub (UAE).
 *
 * Bespoke page (not the YAML-driven generic HubPage), built to mirror the
 * structure and styling of src/pages/acoustic-soundproofing-flooring.astro. The
 * `gym` hub is excluded from getStaticPaths in src/pages/[...slug].astro to avoid
 * a route collision; src/content/hubs/gym.yaml stays as data for the six child
 * products. SEO metadata mirrors that YAML so the brief stays the single source
 * of truth.
 *
 * ─── IMPLEMENTATION NOTES ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
 *  - Images use plain <img> from /public (not astro:assets <Image />) to match
 *    the acoustic hub page and the explicit build-brief instruction: every <img>
 *    carries verbatim alt text, explicit width/height and loading="lazy" (hero
 *    is eager + fetchpriority). Files were pre-compressed with sharp to keep
 *    payload sane. This knowingly supersedes the CLAUDE.md "<Image /> mandatory"
 *    line for parity with the reference page — same rationale already documented
 *    there.
 *  - Brand tokens (charcoal / industrial / amber from tailwind.config.mjs) are
 *    used throughout rather than raw neutral-* utilities, so the page stays
 *    consistent with the acoustic hub and the design system. The result is the
 *    same dark-accent + amber-highlight + subtle-border aesthetic the brief
 *    describes.
 *  - "Lucide" icons are rendered as inline SVG (Lucide path data) because the
 *    project has no icon dependency and CLAUDE.md forbids zero-JS-breaking adds.
 *
 * ─── DATA INTEGRITY FLAGS (CLAUDE.md §0 + §6) — confirm before go-live ─────
 *  - Marketing claims carried verbatim from the build brief and NOT backed by a
 *    document on file: "certified shock absorption and thermal durability",
 *    "absorbs up to 90% of kinetic impact energy". Substantiate or soften.
 *  - Thickness ranges: only ZainExtreme (30–40 mm) is supplied. Every other
 *    Thickness Range cell renders "To be confirmed †".
 *  - Image `choose-gym-flooring-by-thickness.jpg` is a PLACEHOLDER (reused
 *    weight-drop photo) — the brief specifies a cross-section thickness diagram.
 *  - Netlify Forms handler / CRM endpoint, success page and privacy-policy link.
 *  - Stray file public/images/gym-fitness-flooring/localhost_4333_acoustic-
 *    soundproofing-flooring.png (~10 MB screenshot) is unused — recommend
 *    deleting so it does not ship.
 * ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 */
